                        (e) educational use in accredited institutions.

                      A "Competitive Offering" is any product, service,
                      hosted platform, dataset, API, or subscription that:
                        (i)   replicates or substantially derives from the
                              analytical frameworks, datasets, scoring
                              methodologies (including but not limited to the
