                              (including via paid SaaS, freemium SaaS with
                              upsell, sponsored placement, or data resale);
                              AND
                        (iii) targets the market for M&A intelligence,
                              market mapping, exit prediction, investor or
                              acquirer intelligence, founder analytics, or
                              health-equity scoring within the women's
                              health, FemTech, reproductive health, maternal
                              health, fertility, menopause, gynecologic, or
                              adjacent life-sciences sectors.

